CGL_OS — FINAL IMPLEMENTATION & ARCHITECTURE SPECIFICATION
================================================================================

PROJECT:
SSC CGL Intelligence OS

PURPOSE:
Upgrade the EXISTING CGL_OS application without rebuilding it from scratch.

PRIMARY RULE:
DO NOT CREATE A NEW APP.

Modify the existing:
- index.html
- app.js
- style.css
- existing IndexedDB database structure
