================================================================================
0. ABSOLUTE NON-NEGOTIABLE REQUIREMENTS
================================================================================

These requirements override convenience.

1. EXISTING DATA MUST NOT BE LOST.

The application currently contains valuable user-created data:
- questions
- knowledge sheets / living compendium sheets
- flashcards / Anki assets
- attempts
- saved mocks / blueprints
- notes
- configuration
- taxonomy
- AI consultation records
- active-session information where applicable

This data is more important than the UI changes.

Never perform a destructive migration merely because it is easier.

Never:
- clear the database
- recreate the database from scratch
- delete an object store unnecessarily
- regenerate all IDs
- replace existing questions with newly generated questions
- replace knowledge sheets with newly generated sheets
- silently overwrite existing records
- reset taxonomy to a hardcoded default
- clear attempts
- clear saved mocks
- remove backup/restore functionality

2. THE EXISTING DATABASE IS THE SOURCE OF TRUTH.

The current app uses IndexedDB with:

DB_NAME:
cgl_os_db

Current schema:
15

