34. RANDOMIZATION
================================================================================

Randomization must be genuine.

Do not use:

questions.slice(0, count)

as the primary random mode.

Implement Fisher-Yates or equivalent unbiased shuffle.

Example:

pool = eligible questions

shuffle(pool)

selected = pool.slice(0, requestedCount)

Randomization must happen on each new mock generation.

Two identical mock configurations should not necessarily produce the same questions.

